  "provenance": "Native mode_qnm_frequencies is queried by signature only. Independent Kerr values are dimensionless QNM eigenvalues from kerr_qnm_generated.dimensionless_qnm(l,m,n,a_f), converted as f=(Re omega/2pi)*(M/Mf), with damping width=(Im omega/2pi)*(M/Mf). Remnant API docstring cites Husa et al. arXiv:1508.07250 Eqs. 16-17 and reports Mf [solar masses], af, and M*f quantities. The 4,3 independent clean table is unsupported and is reported as an API gap.",
